  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4dca46f39a84a1663618a430e087d88ac10e3c3e2017cdea8d45b1b476b9b3e9.png] \n\nGiven numbers: 9 and 2\n\n= __2 ÷ 3__ + 9 - 4 = 6\n\n= __0.66____ + 9__ - 4 = 6\n\n= __9.66 - 4__ = 6\n\n= 5.66 ≠ 6\n\nAfter interchange the numbers we get:\n\n= __**2 ÷ 3**__ + 9 - 4 = 6\n\n= __0.66____** + 9**__ - 4 = 6\n\n= __9.66** - 4**__ = 6\n\n= 5.66 ≠ 6\n\nThus, this will not be correct.\n\n2) 9 + 4 × 2 - 6 = 32\n\nAfter interchange the numbers we get:\n\n= 2 + __**4 × 9**__ - 6 = 32\n\n= __**2**____** + **____3__6 - 6 = 32\n\n= **__38__**__** - 6**__ = 32\n\n= 32 = 32\n\n3) 9 - 2 + 7 = 0\n\nAfter interchange the numbers we get:\n\n= __**2**__ - 9__** + 7**__ = 0\n\n= __9** - 9**__ = 0\n\n= 0 = 0\n\n4) 2 + 9 × 3 - 4 = 11\n\nAfter interchange the numbers we get:\n\n= 9 + __**2 × 3**__ - 4 = 11\n\n= __**9 + 6 - 4**__ = 11\n\n= 11 = 11\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"9 ÷ 3 + 2 - 4 = 6\".**",
